GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：日晒 Natural\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          风味：柚子、橙子、小青芒、蓝莓干\n         </span>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Pomelo, Orange, Mango, Dried blueberry\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理方式：厌氧蜜处理 Anaerobic Honey\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味：伯爵茶、黄柠檬、百香果、西梅、茉莉绿茶\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n          Earl grey tea, Lemon, Passionfruit, Prune, Jasmine tea-like\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='color: black;font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          这两只豆子也是意料之外的产品，当时测到的时候是6月底，在这之前新产季的豆子都已经大部分采购和到港了，拿到他们的样本半信半疑的测了看看，一测发现好意外，怎么到这个时间点了产区还有这么好的豆子么有卖出去，真的是一分价钱一分货，他们的价格在这个产季里算是高的，但它满足了我们选品的两个特殊癖好，1-第一次碰到 2-很好喝，于是就各订了5包；双11前到港，现在总算是可以上线了；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          这两款豆子都很“柑橘”，但又有各自不同的侧重点，日晒入口柚子皮般的果香复合青芒，随后转莓果干像葡萄干蓝莓干般的厚实的口感与发酵的果感，余韵部分又有点柚子茶的感觉，整体感觉很“扎实”；而厌氧蜜处理让人有点小惊喜，入口非常的干净，透亮，一下子你就感受到柑橘的水果和果茶的那种细腻的香气和酸质，中间甚至会有一些像百香果的综合热带水果的香气，种低温会感受到西梅和蓝莓的混合莓果感觉，尾韵又很绿茶\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span 