           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QialQKWGwVbrUJ3qWQBjwVwXRACVAD7IkmRU86SPQGW1iaYxSKaxANtxYDtpdNwcqapCfWM4TpnYdA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QialQKWGwVbrUJ3qWQBjwVw8QnJjumdMgibRibcsEvt8dN4a4nRCO3I7TJwqTdic3NeCoiaKWFrE2TurA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于本批次的处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          在厌氧发酵蜜处理的过程中，咖农手工采摘下完全成熟的咖啡鲜果，之后运送至ALO咖啡的水洗站，并在门口进行筛选，然后在预清洗之前对咖啡鲜果再次分类，通过观察咖啡鲜果的颜色，来确保鲜果成熟度均匀，再将它们放入塑料桶\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.034em;\">\n          中。这样做是为了帮助整个发酵阶段始终保持无氧状态，在那之后去除咖啡鲜果的果皮和果肉。随后，将塑料桶中的咖啡鲜果倒在升高的非洲晒床上，将脱去果皮和果肉的咖啡鲜果薄铺成一层，让发酵汁充分排出。在整个晾晒过程中始终谨慎地将咖啡鲜果铺成薄薄的一层，是为了避免外部微生物活动，因为在此之前咖啡果实已经在桶中进行了必要的发酵。在14-18天后，含水率降到目标水平。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          经过厌氧发酵蜜处理之后，咖啡呈现出馥郁的花香和柑橘芳香，与其清甜多汁的风味相得益彰，并伴随有顺滑、清爽的茶感。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;white-space: normal;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);outline: 0px;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
